### Variables globales
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7242
@adminToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
@userToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### ========================================
### ENERGY CONSUMPTION ANALYTICS TESTS
### ========================================

### 1. Get consumption stats for device (last 7 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-08T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 2. Get consumption stats for device (last month)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 3. Get consumption stats for zone
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/zone/1?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 4. Get consumption stats for all zones
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/zone/2?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 5. Get hourly consumption data for device
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/horaire?date=2024-01-15
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 6. Get hourly consumption data for today
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/horaire?date={{$datetime iso8601}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 7. Get consumption trends (last 30 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/tendances?nombreJours=30
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 8. Get consumption trends (last 7 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/tendances?nombreJours=7
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 9. Get consumption trends (last 90 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/tendances?nombreJours=90
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 10. Detect consumption anomalies
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/anomalies?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 11. Generate consumption report for zone
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/rapport?zoneId=1&startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 12. Generate consumption report for all zones
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/rapport?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 13. Calculate energy cost (French tariff example)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/cout?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z&tarifKwh=0.15
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 14. Calculate energy cost (high tariff)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/cout?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z&tarifKwh=0.25
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 15. Get top 10 energy consumers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/top-consommateurs?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z&top=10
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 16. Get top 5 energy consumers in specific zone
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/top-consommateurs?zoneId=1&startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z&top=5
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 17. Compare consumption between two periods
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/comparaison?startDate1=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate1=2024-01-15T23:59:59Z&startDate2=2024-01-16T00:00:00Z&endDate2=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 18. Compare monthly consumption (Jan vs Feb)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/comparaison?startDate1=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate1=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z&startDate2=2024-02-01T00:00:00Z&endDate2=2024-02-29T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ========================================
### ERROR SCENARIOS
### ========================================

### 19. Test unauthorized access
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-08T23:59:59Z

### 20. Test invalid date range (start > end)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1?startDate=2024-01-31T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-01T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 21. Test non-existent device
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/999?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-08T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 22. Test non-existent zone
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/zone/999?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 23. Test invalid trend days (too high)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/tendances?nombreJours=500
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 24. Test invalid trend days (zero)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/tendances?nombreJours=0
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 25. Test negative energy tariff
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/cout?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z&tarifKwh=-0.15
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 26. Test zero energy tariff
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/cout?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z&tarifKwh=0
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 27. Test invalid top parameter (too high)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/top-consommateurs?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z&top=200
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 28. Test invalid top parameter (zero)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/top-consommateurs?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z&top=0
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 29. Test invalid comparison dates (period 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/comparaison?startDate1=2024-01-31T00:00:00Z&endDate1=2024-01-01T23:59:59Z&startDate2=2024-02-01T00:00:00Z&endDate2=2024-02-15T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 30. Test invalid comparison dates (period 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/comparaison?startDate1=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate1=2024-01-15T23:59:59Z&startDate2=2024-02-15T00:00:00Z&endDate2=2024-02-01T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ========================================
### ADVANCED ANALYTICS TESTS
### ========================================

### 31. Get consumption stats for different device types
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/2?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 32. Get weekend vs weekday consumption
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/horaire?date=2024-01-13
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 33. Get hourly consumption for weekend
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/horaire?date=2024-01-14
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 34. Long-term trend analysis (6 months)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/tendances?nombreJours=180
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 35. Short-term anomaly detection (last week)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/anomalies?startDate=2024-01-22T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-29T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 36. Quarterly consumption report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/rapport?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-03-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 37. Peak hour cost calculation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/cout?startDate=2024-01-15T08:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-15T18:00:00Z&tarifKwh=0.20
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 38. Off-peak hour cost calculation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/cout?startDate=2024-01-15T18:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-16T08:00:00Z&tarifKwh=0.12
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 39. Year-over-year comparison
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/peripherique/1/comparaison?startDate1=2023-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate1=2023-01-31T23:59:59Z&startDate2=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate2=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 40. Get top 3 consumers with zone filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consommationstats/top-consommateurs?zoneId=2&startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z&top=3
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}